  "_comment": "Ad catalogue for Breakout - same placements, sizes and rules as Pac-Man. 'continue' plays on Game Over's Watch Ad & Continue. 'restart' plays on the in-game Restart button (once per attempt). 'level_gate' plays after Congratulations, when Next Level is pressed, on every 3rd level (3, 6, 9 ...). 'recover' plays 5 times in a row on Level Select when the player unlocks a level after a 24-hour reset. All videos are skippable after 10 seconds. If an ad fails to load, its reward is not granted. 'level_complete_banner' is the IAB MREC 300x250 inside the Congratulations popup. 'banner' is the IAB VERTICAL_BANNER 300x600 shown beside the board during play on landscape screens (one or two cards). 'leaderboard' is the IAB LEADER_BOARD 970x90 shown above the board on portrait / narrow screens. Every image placement rotates to its next creative every 5 seconds; adding an ad to a placement extends its rotation with no code change. All creatives are bundled locally so playback never depends on reaching an outside domain.",
